# CB1-TP4 candidate: the K64j extent program at ONE KV head per chip (the four-card attention shape) at FULL scope on one
# card: every capacity family of the harness default (2304, 16896, 33024, 65792, 98560, 131328), the default starts inside
# each family, three seeds, both served geometries (G16B1 0x21, G8B2 0x23), extent program bit-equal to the compile-time twin
# on the poisoned table. No timing, no legacy numerics arm. A committed TEMPLATE of .github/c2-serving-job.env: placeholders
# in @...@ are filled in by the driver. The harness runs its own pinned image and mounts this checkout's scripts.
# Read the K64J_NKV1 verdict line (scope full, differing 0).
